<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  RM_Damages_ContactVenom.xml                VENOMVINE_CONTACT_VENOM_BUILD_1

  The scratch a contact-venom plant deals, and nothing else. Design:
  design/Jawa/worldbuilding/desert_shade_plants_design.md SS1b "damage shape".

  Shape copied from Core's own ScratchToxic (MEASURED 2026-09-20,
  Data/Core/Defs/DamageDefs/Damages_MeleeWeapon.xml): ParentName="Scratch"
  plus additionalHediffs is all it takes to make a scratch carry a hediff —
  no C# is involved in the venom at all, and MapComponent_ContactVenom never
  names a HediffDef.

  Deliberately NOT ToxicBuildup, which ScratchToxic uses. ToxicBuildup is
  shared planetary-toxin accounting that Biotech tox-resistance genes and gas
  masks already zero, and it is lethal at the same 1.0 as toxic fallout
  exposure — which would make one thorn scratch and a fallout day the same
  disease. The arid shrubland sheet says "a scratch carries venom with
  serious results" from A SCRATCH, so the venom is its own hediff with its
  own decay and its own lethal threshold.

  No victimSeverityScaling stat on purpose: ARMOUR is the counter here, not a
  gas mask. The scratch is a Sharp-category injury (inherited from Scratch),
  so Sharp leg armour reduces it, and a scratch reduced to 0 damage delivers
  0 x severityPerDamageDealt = no venom at all. That is the whole avoidance
  mechanic and it needs no new stat.
-->
<Defs>

  <DamageDef ParentName="Scratch">
    <defName>RM_VenomvineScratch</defName>
    <label>venom scratch</label>
    <deathMessage>{0} has been killed by venomous thorns.</deathMessage>
    <additionalHediffs>
      <li>
        <hediff>RM_VenomvineVenom</hediff>
        <!-- One full 3-damage scratch = 0.12 venom. Lingering nets +0.10/h
             against the hediff's own -0.5/day decay, so: serious stage at
             ~3 h in the vines, lethal at ~9 h. A pawn that merely crosses a
             stand carries minor-stage pain for about six hours and nothing
             else. -->
        <severityPerDamageDealt>0.04</severityPerDamageDealt>
        <!-- A Jawa takes a serious dose from the same thorn a bantha
             shrugs off. -->
        <victimSeverityScalingByInvBodySize>true</victimSeverityScalingByInvBodySize>
      </li>
    </additionalHediffs>
    <applyAdditionalHediffsIfHuntingForFood>false</applyAdditionalHediffsIfHuntingForFood>
    <impactSoundType>Toxic</impactSoundType>
    <damageEffecter>Impact_Toxic</damageEffecter>
  </DamageDef>

</Defs>
